# Tasheel Project Rules

## Project
Tasheel (تسهيل) is an enterprise service management platform with two portals:
- Admin Portal: create services, build forms, design BPMN workflows, publish
- Requester Portal: browse catalog, submit requests, track status

## Tech Stack
- Next.js 14 (App Router, TypeScript strict mode)
- Tailwind CSS 3.4
- shadcn/ui (New York style, Slate base)
- Zustand with persist middleware (localStorage)
- bpmn-js 17.x for workflow designer
- @dnd-kit for drag-and-drop form builder
- Lucide React for icons
- date-fns for date formatting

## Code Conventions
- Use "use client" directive only when component uses hooks, event handlers, or browser APIs
- Prefer server components by default
- Use TypeScript strict mode — no `any` types, no type assertions unless unavoidable
- All components use named exports, not default exports
- File names: kebab-case (service-card.tsx, not ServiceCard.tsx)
- Import paths use @/ alias (e.g., @/components/ui/button)
- All state management through Zustand store at @/lib/store.ts
- No prop drilling beyond 2 levels — use Zustand instead
- CSS: Tailwind utility classes only, no custom CSS files
- Colors: use Tailwind's slate, blue, emerald, amber, red palettes
- All interactive elements need hover/focus/active states

## Component Patterns
- Use shadcn/ui components as base — never rebuild what shadcn provides
- Wrap shadcn components for project-specific behavior (e.g., StatusBadge wraps Badge)
- Form inputs: always include label, placeholder, and error state
- Tables: always include empty state, loading state, and pagination where applicable
- Cards: consistent padding (p-6), border (border), rounded (rounded-lg)
- Buttons: always specify variant and size explicitly

## Data Patterns
- All data flows through Zustand store
- Mock data lives in @/lib/mock-data.ts
- Types live in @/lib/types.ts
- Never hardcode data in components — always reference store or mock data
- Ticket numbers format: TSH-YYYY-NNNN (e.g., TSH-2026-0042)
- Dates: use date-fns format, display as "Apr 15, 2026"

## File Organization
- Pages: app/[portal]/[feature]/page.tsx
- Components: components/[portal]/[component-name].tsx
- Shared components: components/shared/[component-name].tsx
- UI primitives: components/ui/ (shadcn — do not modify directly)
- Utilities: lib/utils.ts, lib/types.ts, lib/store.ts, lib/mock-data.ts
